load @term/seed/code/group
  find group

# The special unitary group: the group of unitary matrices of determinant one, the rotations of complex vector space
# that preserve length and orientation. SU(2) double-covers the rotations of three-space and is the unit quaternions;
# SU(3) is the gauge group of the strong force. The form carries the underlying group; being unitary with determinant
# one is the defining condition.
form special-unitary-group
  link group, like group
